<title>RUSSIA: Russian PPI slows to 0.8 pct monthly in April.</title>
<headline>Russian PPI slows to 0.8 pct monthly in April.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian monthly industrial prices rose 0.8 percent in April after a 1.4 percent increase in March, the State Statistics Committee said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN INDUSTRIAL PRICES  APR 97    MAR 97    APR 96</p>
<p>    Month-on-month pct change    +0.8	+1.4	+2.4</p>
<p>    Year-on-year pct change     +18.2     +20.1     +69.1</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
